    "created_at": "2016-02-24T00:27:10Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-02-24T00:27:10Z",
    "body": "Can you make Bikeshed's data model aware that two definitions with the same text but different IDs are different? I would prefer to continue using IDs as the unique identifier instead of some combination of text content plus Bikeshed-specific attributes.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
