    "created_at": "2016-02-24T19:55:04Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-02-24T19:55:04Z",
    "body": "> I think this is fine, I don't think we'll manage to keep track of this ourselves, but we can add metadata on request.\n\nCool. I don't expect y'all to manage this yourselves; as long as y'all keep up with the ID and markup patterns y'all are using, Shepherd can grab most things correctly, and whenever it messes up people will either work around it or tell me, and I'll PR y'all as appropriate.\n",
